            "review_text": "Laura N\nDublin, Ireland3 contributions\n0\nStay away\nJul 2017 • Couples\nMy boyfriend and I visited this restaurant and were bitterly disappointed. We asked the manager to recommend a local dish and so we ordered crab and some other accompaniments. The place was busy but we were completely ignored by the staff for the whole night. We were shocked when we received the bill. We payed €20 for one crab. That's extremely pricey even for irish standards. We were also charged 4,000 vd for2 hand towels we were never given. The manager then blamed us for being foreign and not understanding the way things work! Extremely over priced avoid!\nWritten July 28, 2017",
