            "review_text": "KT H\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat Food & Service\nJun 2017 • Family\nEnded up going here twice. The food was so good and the manager really helped us in selecting a great menu for both meals. The first night we had a huge dinner for four with a variety of different items including fresh seafood, prawns, fish, etc. With beer and a huge dinner for 4 it only cost us a little over $100. Such a great fine dinning experience. The manager Diep was so helpful in showing us how to wrap the fish in rice paper and went above and beyond in helping us try unique pieces that represent the Vietnamese culture.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 26, 2017",
